{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:45:658","content":{"id":658,"title":"文档组织","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"78a88b43-ac00-411d-9a52-03e3c3284bc9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在本节中介绍一些有效组织文档的技术，包括对元素进行分组，复用已有的元素"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"0a9fa24e-6686-4eab-b82b-38a84840647a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"分组"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"15b6928a-5ede-4ebc-94a3-68048852ebd4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在画布中，有些形状是一体的，比如我们要绘制一只小鸟，小鸟由身体的各个部位（头、身体、翅膀等）组成，这些部位应该归为一组，这样方便我们管理，并且在阅读代码时也会比较清晰；再者也方便作为一个整体进行操作，比如整体做一个变换（旋转，缩放），或者整体填充一个颜色，不用为身体的各个部分分别单独指定相同颜色，只需要指定在其父级，子元素会自动继承颜色。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/grouping-bird2022-01-20-19-49-59.svg","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/ImgHosting3/raw/master/grouping-bird2022-01-20-19-49-59.svg","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"4c53125e-492d-446e-bf5a-13bd0395dea3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c6b7f767-8b15-448a-acdf-312e6ba7fdbc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的小鸟再逻辑上应该是一体的，我们有必要将其分为一组，以便统一操作。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9b0adef3-f924-4da4-8718-8bbf67c4aa6b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 SVG 中，我们通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"g"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签进行分组，其中的元素是一组，给出上述小鸟的例子"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"382f6fcd-84b3-48df-8f20-b9f10960537e","